  vendorName: Tailor Reginald
  offerText: Your wardrobe is utterly tragic, sir. Pay my exorbitant fee, and I shall
    leave you with a massive, heavily starched coat that will grant you an air of
    pure authority.
  acceptResultText: You pay the tailor and don the heavy coat. You look remarkably
    distinguished in the mirror.
  rejectResultText: You laugh at his arrogant sales pitch and throw him out. Feeling
    incredibly empowered, you spend the hour happily throwing away old clothes you
    no longer need.
